13 write a python program to take a string and separate characters present even index positions and odd index positions

s = input("Enter a string: ")

even = ""
odd = ""

for i in range(len(s)):
    if i % 2 == 0:
        even += s[i]
    else:
        odd += s[i]

print("Characters at even index positions:", even)
print("Characters at odd index positions:", odd)
